usage: reproduce.py [-h] [{baseline,candidate,all}]

Rebuild this review's isolated source closure without modifying the checkout.
The baseline is intentionally expected to fail the ownership contract. Its
race probes must also report DATA RACE. Candidate checks must pass. Go
dependencies are pinned by the archived go.mod/go.sum; a populated module
cache is required when network access is unavailable.

positional arguments:
  {baseline,candidate,all}

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
